Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:34:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/27] nexus_engine 0.5: F12 recording key, Alt+F12
 screenshots, games keep running behind NEXUS Home

- shortcuts with modifiers ("Alt+F12"); a shortcut with modifiers never conflicts with a game key;
  screenshot (Alt+F12) is matched before recording (F12) by exact modifiers
- recordKey: presses are counted for NEXUS (recordPresses), which records the window itself
- nexus_engine_background: NEXUS Home keeps the game running with its window hidden and keyboard,
  mouse, touch and controller input blocked by an SDL event filter before the input layer
  (device connect/disconnect still pass); nexus_engine_suspend(1) still pauses
- nexus_engine_screenshot (also while in the background), nexus_engine_window (HWND for capture)
- status: recordPresses, background

(cherry picked from commit 023bcf32ae1ed1debab46932a07efb368facb4fc)
